### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3030/api/v1

### 1. Home
GET {{baseUrl}}/home

### 2. Channel Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/channel/t-sports

### 3. Channels by Category - Trending
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/trending?page=1

### 4. Channels by Category - Sports
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/sports?page=1

### 5. Channels by Category - News
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/news?page=1

### 6. Channels by Category - Documentary
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/documentary?page=1

### 7. Channels by Category - Kids
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/kids?page=1

### 8. Channels by Category - Islamic
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/islamic?page=1

### 9. Categories - Trending
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/trending?page=1

### 10. Categories - Sports
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/sports?page=1

### 11. Search Channels
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?keyword=bbc&page=1

### 12. Servers (Channel Sources)
GET {{baseUrl}}/servers?id=t-sports

### 13. Stream (Channel Source)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stream?id=t-sports
